title: (none)

callout 2562b0630f1e pitfall
<p>Two calls of <code>grant_vote()</code> in one term:</p><ul><li>the first one sets <code>s-&gt;voted_for</code>;</li><li>the second one returns <strong>false</strong>, unless the same candidate asks.</li></ul><pre class="md-code"><code><span class="tok-variable tok-function">grant_vote</span><span class="tok-punctuation tok-section">(</span>s<span class="tok-punctuation tok-separator">,</span> <span class="tok-constant tok-numeric">6</span><span class="tok-punctuation tok-separator">,</span> <span class="tok-constant tok-numeric">1</span><span class="tok-punctuation tok-section">)</span><span class="tok-punctuation tok-terminator">;</span></code></pre><blockquote><p>A plain quote inside a callout stays a quote.</p></blockquote>
